==== Modifications (Edge API / RandallFlare) ====

This tree is a modified version of QuantumNous/new-api, rewritten to run as a
Cloudflare Workers-compatible Worker on RandallFlare (workerd + D1 + KV +
static assets via @bigrandall/rrangler).

Material changes from upstream:

- Runtime: Go/Gin + embedded React replaced by a TypeScript Worker on workerd.
- Storage: MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite-via-GORM replaced by D1 (SQLite) + KV.
- Password hashing: Argon2id/bcrypt replaced by Web Crypto PBKDF2-SHA256
  (existing upstream password hashes are not portable).
- The original QuantumNous/new-api TanStack + Rsbuild frontend is vendored
  under web/ and served as ASSETS (public/ is the production build). It is
  not a compact replacement SPA.
- Channel types that require vendor SDKs or local plugins (AWS SigV4 service
  accounts, Vertex service-account JWT minting, in-process JS task plugins)
  are exposed in the catalog and will relay when the channel is
  OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini compatible or uses HTTP pass-through; otherwise they
  return a structured error. Stripe/Epay/Creem/Waffo checkout use HTTP APIs
  (no vendor SDK). Task plugins are a D1 registry plus passthrough routes.
- Password storage and session cookies are HMAC-signed on the Worker.

